PTX mbarrier-arrive-drop
"arrive_drop counts as an arrival and lowers the expected count of later phases (9.7.13.15.14): with count 2, P0's arrive_drop and P1's arrive complete phase 0; then one arrive of P1 completes phase 1. Expected: forbidden (the wait for phase 1 must return True)."
{
b=mbarrier(2) @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0           | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 mbarrier.arrive_drop.release.cta b | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta b                  ;
                                    | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
                                    | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta b                  ;
                                    | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r1, b, 1 ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
